lon, Avatar of the Mahasattva","database_level":0},{"enemy_id":"enemy_2090_skzjbc","slug":"padmasana_of_rebirth","name":"Padmasana of Rebirth","database_level":0,"overrides":{"hp":100000}},{"enemy_id":"enemy_2091_skzgds","slug":"window","name":"'Window'","database_level":0}],"suppliedUnits":{"fixed_squad":[],"deployable_tokens":[]},"hasConditionalSpawns":true},"borrowedGeometryFrom":null,"enemyDetails":{"serious_bitey":{"slug":"serious_bitey","name":"Serious 'Bitey'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Serious 'Bitey'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A common Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. It's very smart and actually understands human speech. Apparently some kind of communal organism, it gets lonely when left by itself. Now it's actually getting down to business like a real Ink Spirit.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":500,"def":150,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"complicated_envy":{"slug":"complicated_envy","name":"Complicated 'Envy'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Complicated 'Envy'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A fearsome Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Frightening in appearance and feared by all. Very territorial and doesn't get along with most other Ink Spirits. Its emotions and behavioral patterns are particularly complex, perhaps even more so than mere man. Arts can shift Hui and Ming.","abilities":["Can charge its attacks. If not interrupted, causes Arts damage and shifts target's Ming and Hui attribute."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":1200,"def":220,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"chalice_of_regret":{"slug":"chalice_of_regret","name":"Chalice of Regret","icon":"/enemies-icons/Chalice of Regret.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"Soul chalice born of a revenant's will, brimming with regret unfathomable. The past, tormenting yet unchangeable, is the cruelest cut.","abilities":["Flying unit.","Shares a fraction of the damage taken by non-aerial enemies around itself."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":0,"def":0,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"quilon_avatar_of_the_mahasattva":{"slug":"quilon_avatar_of_the_mahasattva","name":"Qui'lon, Avatar of the Mahasattva","icon":"/enemies-icons/Qui'lon, Avatar of the Mahasattva.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Sarkaz","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The enlightened of Terra, an Anasa. His Cakraratna is Civilight Eterna, and his Dharmaparaya is a shattered sword. If the living wishes to be free from their worldly shackles, he will remain among the rubble to preach the Dharma, walking the path of Duhkha once more.","abilities":["State of Samadhi","[Tathata] After a period of invulnerability, enters State of Vimutti","[Anapanasati] Periodically summons Aggini of Nila; for every existing Aggini of Nila, Qui'lon takes less Physical and Arts damage, and gains status resistance","[Quenching the Three Fires] Qui'lon periodically deals Arts damage to all units within range of an Aggini of Nila","State of Vimutti","[Anapanasati] Gains status resistance; periodically summons Aggini of Nila, and for every existing Aggini of Nila, Qui'lon takes less Physical and Arts damage; periodically summons a wave of enemies, and when the mind is chaotic, summons different enemies","[Wrathful Gaze] Every attack deals Arts damage to all units within range of an Aggini of Nila","[Breaching of the Five Precepts] Unleashes 5 consecutive attacks on the target","[Trikaya] Summons a 'Padmasana of Rebirth' whenever 25% of Max HP is lost; Invulnerable until 'Padmasana of Rebirth' enters the Objective Point","[Upaya] When HP drops to 0% for the first time, removes all allied and enemy units from the field along with all Operators in the Deployment Waiting Zone, then enters State of Ashoka","State of Ashoka","[Debate of the Bodhisattvas] Moves to a new combat map and attacks strike twice; only Operators who were on the 'Padmasana of Rebirth' when it entered the Objective Point can be used"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":300000,"atk":1800,"def":2000,"res":75,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"dazzled_smarty":{"slug":"dazzled_smarty","name":"Dazzled 'Smarty'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Dazzled 'Smarty'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A strange Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Seems to be alive. Very lively with its movements and likes to wander around. It explodes if it touches any fellow Ink Spirits with opposite attributes, so any survivors tend to be even more powerful.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by player's units of the same attribute.","Explodes upon death, dealing Arts damage to friendly units. Causes even greater damage if similar units of the opposite attribute are in its vicinity"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":3700,"atk":150,"def":0,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"sharpedge":{"slug":"sharpedge","name":"Sharpedge","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sharpedge.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. The weaponry yet again dreams of the past. A Waregeist of this type rouses its old memories as though it is taking to the battlefield again. Its strength is doubled as it and its peers rally each other.","abilities":["Consumes Broken Blades to gain increased ATK","When defeated, each unconsumed Broken Blade will spawn a <Iron Spearhead> (minimum 1)"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":20000,"atk":1350,"def":750,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.2}},"unbridled_fury":{"slug":"unbridled_fury","name":"Unbridled 'Fury'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Unbridled 'Fury'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A strong Ink Spirit named by the painter herself. Its great power and might is how it frees itself from the worries of having to think, allowing it to destroy all in its wake with its flaming inferno. Other than its buddy Bitey, that is. Gains attack power against opposite attribute enemies.","abilities":["Greatly increases ATK when attacking opposite attribute targets"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":2200,"def":900,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"padmasana_of_rebirth":{"slug":"padmasana_of_rebirth","name":"Padmasana of Rebirth","icon":"/enemies-icons/Padmasana of Rebirth.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Flying","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"It has no bottom yet never leaks, ferrying passengers from all lands to greener pastures atop a bed of cerulean flames. Only the freed may board this ark.","abilities":["Loads up to 3 allied Operators upon contact. Movement speed is reduced when loaded.","Will not deduct Life Points when entering the Objective Point; loaded allied Operators cannot be placed on the field"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":100000,"atk":500,"def":2000,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"lost_hovercraft":{"slug":"lost_hovercraft","name":"Lost Hovercraft","icon":"/enemies-icons/Lost Hovercraft.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An automated thought collector built by a lost Kazdelian empire. Despite its ability to hover for extended periods, its built-in package protection mechanism compels it to land immediately upon encountering interference.","abilities":["Low-Altitude Hovering","Steals Originium Ingots upon entering the Objective."],"levelCount":3,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.35,"stats":{"hp":8000,"atk":700,"def":550,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"magnificence":{"slug":"magnificence","name":"Magnificence","icon":"/enemies-icons/Magnificence.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Apparition","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A Waregeist that manifested when it was infected by Sui-Xiang. Its tiny glimmer serves as a beacon casting light upon the dark night. A Waregeist of this type not only blesses its peers with its radiance, but is also particularly destructive.","abilities":["Periodically grants temporary Invisibility to surrounding enemy units","Spawns 1 <Iron Lampstand> when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":700,"def":1050,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"portal":{"slug":"portal","name":"'Portal'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Portal'.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A portal that follows the living and can occasionally be encountered in the Furnace. Do not fear if it compels you t